This license covers the cost-calculation and pricing logic ported from
@slkiser/opencode-quota into opencode-enhanced-sidebar-zh:

- src/metrics/token-buckets.ts (token bucket extraction/summing)
- src/metrics/token-cost.ts (USD cost formula with cache/reasoning fallbacks)
- src/metrics/pricing.ts (models.dev snapshot normalization, runtime cache,
  refresh policy, provider/model alias resolution)
- src/data/modelsdev-pricing.min.json (bundled models.dev pricing snapshot)

